WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.288 --> 00:00:02.087
- Makes your breath bacon-fresh.

00:00:02.087 --> 00:00:04.392
I can only imagine how putrid my breath

00:00:04.392 --> 00:00:06.028
must smell right now.

00:00:06.028 --> 00:00:08.611
(upbeat music)

00:00:10.324 --> 00:00:11.514
- I was raised kosher

00:00:11.514 --> 00:00:14.164
and then I became a
vegetarian for a lot of years,

00:00:14.164 --> 00:00:17.943
so I've actually had very
little bacon-eating time

00:00:17.943 --> 00:00:19.229
in my life.

00:00:19.229 --> 00:00:20.659
- I remember what it tastes like.

00:00:20.659 --> 00:00:21.492
It was good.

00:00:21.492 --> 00:00:22.836
It smells good, tastes good,

00:00:22.836 --> 00:00:24.985
just not a fan of eating pigs.

00:00:24.985 --> 00:00:26.549
- I mean I do miss bacon.

00:00:26.549 --> 00:00:28.250
Who the hell doesn't miss bacon?

00:00:28.250 --> 00:00:30.031
- I sometimes miss the taste of bacon

00:00:30.031 --> 00:00:32.016
but now they have fake bacon stuff,

00:00:32.016 --> 00:00:33.099
so who cares!

00:00:35.389 --> 00:00:37.581
- So I guess these are crackers

00:00:37.581 --> 00:00:41.618
that have been imbued
with the spirit of bacon.

00:00:41.618 --> 00:00:44.236
- Smells like really fatty, fatty bacon.

00:00:44.236 --> 00:00:46.048
- This really isn't made with any...

00:00:46.048 --> 00:00:48.798
It's just like this, interesting.

00:00:50.327 --> 00:00:51.915
- The bacon is subtle.

00:00:51.915 --> 00:00:53.907
- I feel like it smells more bacon-y

00:00:53.907 --> 00:00:56.523
than it tastes, but it's good.

00:00:56.523 --> 00:00:58.023
- I imagine the person that wants this

00:00:58.023 --> 00:01:00.327
is also the person that
like gets mad at me

00:01:00.327 --> 00:01:04.410
for not eating meat even
if I didn't bring it up.

00:01:06.182 --> 00:01:09.133
- It has little fake bacon chunks

00:01:09.133 --> 00:01:11.724
(chuckles) in the chocolate.

00:01:11.724 --> 00:01:13.067
- Bacon bits. Vegetarian.

00:01:13.067 --> 00:01:15.023
I've had plenty of those.

00:01:15.023 --> 00:01:18.672
- There's even a little fake fat in there.

00:01:18.672 --> 00:01:19.861
- It's crunchy.

00:01:19.861 --> 00:01:22.567
- If someone gave this
to me I wouldn't even

00:01:22.567 --> 00:01:25.734
like pinpoint the bacon flavor at all.

00:01:29.184 --> 00:01:32.017
- They're the color of bacon. Ugh.

00:01:33.575 --> 00:01:35.678
Whoa. Tastes like feet.

00:01:35.678 --> 00:01:38.246
- It's like a mix of mint

00:01:38.246 --> 00:01:40.163
and smoky bacon flavor.

00:01:41.018 --> 00:01:43.695
- I'm getting it, it's smoky.

00:01:43.695 --> 00:01:46.071
- Impossible to blow a bubble with this.

00:01:46.071 --> 00:01:48.651
- (blowing) No.

00:01:48.651 --> 00:01:51.568
- (blowing) Kinda.

00:01:53.288 --> 00:01:55.950
- (snap) I just blew a snot bubble

00:01:55.950 --> 00:01:58.950
at the same time I blew this bubble.

00:01:59.790 --> 00:02:01.987
- It looks like normal toothpaste.

00:02:01.987 --> 00:02:05.404
Like there's no red stripe which is nice.

00:02:07.137 --> 00:02:09.335
- Circles that's what
you're supposed to do.

00:02:09.335 --> 00:02:10.475
- Put it on my tongue.

00:02:10.475 --> 00:02:12.153
- This doesn't taste like bacon.

00:02:12.153 --> 00:02:14.072
It just tastes like mint mixed with

00:02:14.072 --> 00:02:17.262
some sort of like weird smoky flavor.

00:02:17.262 --> 00:02:19.761
- This is just dog things

00:02:19.761 --> 00:02:21.784
repurposed as human things.

00:02:21.784 --> 00:02:23.001
Maybe this is why my dog

00:02:23.001 --> 00:02:24.952
doesn't like getting her teeth brushed.

00:02:24.952 --> 00:02:26.425
- There's an after taste of bacon.

00:02:26.425 --> 00:02:27.500
A little bit.

00:02:27.500 --> 00:02:29.656
- I feel like it would
be smart for a dentist

00:02:29.656 --> 00:02:32.114
to approve it if it does prevent cavities.

00:02:32.114 --> 00:02:33.638
Let's say you have a little kid

00:02:33.638 --> 00:02:37.326
who won't brush their
teeth but loves bacon...

00:02:37.326 --> 00:02:40.159
You can get them bacon toothpaste.

00:02:42.704 --> 00:02:45.239
- I hope my dentist is watching this.

00:02:45.239 --> 00:02:47.183
- Ooh okay. If you're gonna have breath

00:02:47.183 --> 00:02:49.134
of any sort and it's not minty.

00:02:49.134 --> 00:02:51.287
Bacon's not a horrible option.

00:02:51.287 --> 00:02:52.933
- I think this could fool someone

00:02:52.933 --> 00:02:55.563
into thinking this is
what bacon tastes like

00:02:55.563 --> 00:02:59.270
if they haven't eaten it
in longer than I have.

00:02:59.270 --> 00:03:01.109
- I think I've realized through today

00:03:01.109 --> 00:03:03.263
none of these products have made me

00:03:03.263 --> 00:03:05.835
either yearn for more bacon in my life,

00:03:05.835 --> 00:03:08.585
nor more bacon flavor in my life.

00:03:09.472 --> 00:03:10.853
- If I was at all missing meat

00:03:10.853 --> 00:03:13.853
before this experience I am so happy

00:03:14.700 --> 00:03:16.867
with just cutting it out.

00:03:16.867 --> 00:03:19.450
(upbeat music)

